resolution:
1. Connect via administrative socket: mysql -u root -p
2. Inspect active threads: SHOW PROCESSLIST;
3. Identify stuck Sleep queries and terminate if necessary.
4. Temporarily increase dynamic limit: SET GLOBAL max_connections = 500;
5. Make persistent in /etc/mysql/my.cnf: max_connections = 500 and wait_timeout = 300.
6. Restart connection pooler in backend application.
